==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage. Just spam some attackers at lv 20 and you're good.

==Trivia==
*Mentai Domain is named after the Japanese word 明太 ''mentai'' ([[wikipedia:Alaska pollock|Alaska pollock]]).

